      how: { q: 'How do I choose the farm animals?', steps: ['Build a Farm (Town list).', 'Tap it: its box opens beside it.', 'Tap the animals to raise (ticked ones are lit); tap again to stop raising one. − and + beside People set how many work there.'] },
